## Maybe

::bg{location="hearth" time="dawn"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: The fire does not settle this time. It stays high, and the door to the Stair stays shut, as if something were deciding.
@sable{code="0010" os}: It's thinking about letting you go. Don't make a sound.
